{"text": "Next time someone makes you feel unwanted, unlovable or invisible, listen carefully. Do not beg. Do not chase.\n\nDo not exhaust your soul trying to prove your worth to someone who has already decided not to see it. Instead, become still, and ask yourself one question.\n\nIf this were the last year of your life, would you spend it convincing someone to value you? Or would you put your energy where your presence is already welcome? When a person shows you they do not care, that is the answer. Your work is not to argue with it.\n\nYes, leaving will hurt. Growing usually does. But staying where you are unseen breaks something slowly, and you will not notice until it is gone. Peace begins the moment you stop trying to earn what should have been given freely.\n\nIf you have been proving yourself to someone this year, write the word unseen below, and follow me for the rest.\n\nBut walking away only helps if you can sit with the quiet that follows it. Everything I know is inside The Quiet Between Thoughts. The link is in my profile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "e", "x", "t", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "o", "n", "e", " ", "m", "a", "k", "e", "s", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "f", "e", "e", "l", " ", "u", "n", "w", "a", "n", "t", "e", "d", ",", " ", "u", "n", "l", "o", "v", "a", "b", "l", "e", " ", "o", "r", " ", "i", "n", "v", "i", "s", "i", "b", "l", "e", ",", " ", "l", "i", "s", "t", "e", "n", " ", "c", "a", "r", "e", "f", "u", "l", "l", "y", ".", " ", "D", "o", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "b", "e", "g", ".", " ", "D", "o", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "c", "h", "a", "s", "e", ".", "\n", "\n", "D", "o", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "e", "x", "h", "a", "u", "s", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "s", "o", "u", "l", " ", "t", "r", "y", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", " ", "p", "r", "o", "v", "e", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "w", "o", "r", "t", "h", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "o", "n", "e", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "h", "a", "s", " ", 